+- Moving a member (`POST /projects/{pid}/members/{uid}/move`) takes the member out of
+  the project and adds them to `toProjectId` with the same role. The actor must be a
+  manager of both projects (else 403). The destination must be readable by the actor
+  and in the same organization (else 404). The user must be a member of the source
+  project (else 404). A user already in the destination → 409. The source and the
+  destination must differ (else 400). The member's tasks in the source project are
+  unassigned in the same transaction, so no task is left assigned to a non-member.
